msgstr "[Транскрипт](https://wiki.tomasino.org/writing/Solarpunk-Prompts---The-Experts)"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#: content/seeds/the-fire-brigade/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Fire Brigade"
msgstr "Пожежники"

#. type: Plain text
#: content/seeds/the-fire-brigade/index.en.md
#, no-wrap
msgid "> There is a military unit which switched from tanks to firetrucks decades ago. Now they’re fighting climate disasters, being more engineers and firefighters than soldiers, which is a dream for some and a nightmare for others. The rookies, well-versed in the new reality are struggling to understand the language of the old officer, still clinging to the military jargon and ways.\n"
